      "start": 3.31,
      "end": 85.3,
      "duration": 81.99,
      "text": "Hello, wherever and whenever you're joining us, from morning in Mumbai to midnight in Montego Bay, Jamaica, welcome to the sixth AI4IA conference. This year we gather to commemorate the International Day for Universal Access to Information on our theme AI Access in Focus. Access is not just about connectivity, it's about dignity, equity and empowerment. And so as artificial intelligence becomes more deeply embedded in our lives, let us begin with a truth that should never be a rebuttable presumption. Human dignity is and must always remain the first principle of AI governance. This foundational truth becomes even more critical as we confront the strange but serious reality that we are now creating machines in our own image.",
