      "fragment_index": 4,
      "start": 263.73,
      "end": 343.08,
      "duration": 79.35,
      "text": "It is a call to action to ensure that access is shaped by ethics, guided by empathy and directed towards human flourishing. In closing, I extend heartfelt thanks to the members of the UNESCO IFAP working group on information accessibility, which I have the honor of sharing, members of the AI for IA planning committee, and I salute in particular the dedicated AI for IA conference satellite organizers from India, Jamaica, Canada, Chile, Ukraine, Germany, the UK, South Africa and Zimbabwe. All of us supported by the UNESCO IFAP secretariat in Paris, the UNESCO regional office for Southern Africa, the UNESCO cluster office for the Caribbean, the Broadcasting Commission of Jamaica and the University of Alberta. Thank you for being here.",
